license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: https://github.com/sparkainlp-x/lattice-crystallization
abstract: >-
  Synthetic experiment applying a pattern-specific lateral score to
  streaming-PCA (crystallized) patterns on a 13x12 grid, with a
  held-out frozen gate comparing overlap-only against a combined
  overlap+lateral score under seam-shift and row-slip corruption.
  Classical toy only; no biology, medical, quantum-hardware, brain,
  or consciousness claim.
keywords:
  - synthetic
  - streaming-PCA
  - lateral-score
  - held-out-evaluation
  - refusal-gate
